  http://www.gnu.org/brave-gnu-world/issue-40.ko.html
  [ Korean version ]


or via the "Brave GNU World" homepage

  http://www.gnu.org/brave-gnu-world/brave-gnu-world.en.html
  [ English version ]

  http://www.gnu.org/brave-gnu-world/brave-gnu-world.fr.html
